{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"tid-pair","type":"text","text":"## TID.Pair\n> node: tid-pair\n- `type: id` — the atomic identity primitive\n- used by all graph entities\n- parseable by CLI and linter","x":-280,"y":-580,"width":280,"height":221},
		{"id":"canvas-cli","type":"text","text":"## Agentos.Canvas.CLI\n> node: canvas-cli\n- `agentos canvas` command surface\n- surgical edits: add-node, add-edge, set-status\n- layout is explicit, not automatic\n- derives file node ids from relative path","x":580,"y":332,"width":280,"height":360},
		{"id":"md-block","type":"text","text":"## Md.Block\n> node: md-block\n- heading-scoped markdown unit\n- movable, reusable across surfaces\n- existing Agentos primitive","x":520,"y":-604,"width":280,"height":245},
		{"id":"inline-note-style","type":"text","text":"## Canvas.Inline.Note.Style\n> node: inline-note-style\n- format for inline text nodes only\n- Md.Block + mandatory TID.Pair blockquote\n- file nodes: id derived by CLI from path","x":300,"y":-162,"width":280,"height":297},
		{"id":"canvas","type":"text","text":"## Agentos.Canvas\n> node: canvas\n- visual project map subsystem\n- built on Obsidian.Canvas\n- single shared artifact: human via Obsidian, agent via CLI\n- view layer — does not duplicate content","x":-360,"y":512,"width":280,"height":272},
		{"id":"edge-cli-edits-canvas","type":"text","text":"## edits\n> edge: cli-edits-canvas\n- the CLI is the agent's write interface to the canvas file\n- surgical: add, update, delete — never full rewrite","x":120,"y":784,"width":257,"height":219,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"graph-model","type":"text","text":"## Agentos.Canvas.Graph.Model\n> node: graph-model\n- minimal general graph language\n- nodes and edges declared as TID.Pairs\n- linter v1: every entity has a valid unique TID.Pair","x":-540,"y":-162,"width":320,"height":297},
		{"id":"obsidian-canvas","type":"text","text":"## Obsidian.Canvas\n> node: obsidian-canvas\n- `.canvas` JSON file format\n- inline text nodes + file nodes\n- human-editable in Obsidian","x":-960,"y":414,"width":280,"height":197}
